            "Replace copied DP rows with one contiguous boundary array and four-row register blocking.",
            "Store sorted, deduplicated obstacles contiguously with row offsets; merge four obstacle streams to identify obstacle-free spans.",
            "Use conditional subtraction for modular addition and disable synchronized iostream input."
          ]
        },
