        "hypothesis": "Combining the integrated sparse four-row kernel with static anti-diagonal scheduling may reduce task-management overhead on four cores, while retaining boundary reuse and obstacle-free span processing.",
        "id": "d957c431e0c04324",
        "ordinal": 2,
